  "body": "**Link to problem area**\r\nNo instance of compliance (testing not license) or integration (testing not manager) in the docs except:\r\n* https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/blob/a78a8bb27d482c07ba2f0de32297345901fa1f18/proposals/1779-open-governance.md#L414\r\n* https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/blob/a78a8bb27d482c07ba2f0de32297345901fa1f18/proposals/2540-stricter-event-validation.md#L1\r\n\r\nSearches:\r\nhttps://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/search?q=integration+-%22integration+manager%22&type=\r\nhttps://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/search?q=compliance+-%22compliance+with+the+License.%22\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\nCreate client compliance tests. Link to suggested ones. I couldn't find any integration or compliance tests for matrix clients.\r\n\r\nThere are two projects for testing servers ( https://github.com/matrix-org/complement and https://github.com/matrix-org/sytest ), these should probably also be mentioned in the spec.",
